 a copy of object x."},"sortText":"2copy"},{"label":"cos","kind":3,"detail":"cos(r)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Cosine of r, r in radians."},"sortText":"2cos"},{"label":"cset","kind":3,"detail":"cset(x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Convert x to a cset, failing if that is not possible."},"sortText":"2cset"},{"label":"delay","kind":3,"detail":"delay(i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Delay for i milliseconds."},"sortText":"2delay"},{"label":"delete","kind":3,"detail":"delete(x1,x2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Delete element x2 from set or table x1 if it is there (always succeeds and returns x1)."},"sortText":"2delete"},{"label":"detab","kind":3,"detail":"detab(s,i,...)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Replace tabs with spaces, with stops at columns indicated."},"sortText":"2detab"},{"label":"display","kind":3,"detail":"display(i,f)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Display local variables of i most recent procedure activations, plus global variables. Output to file f (default \u0026errout)."},"sortText":"2display"},{"label":"dtor","kind":3,"detail":"dtor(r)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Convert r from degrees to radians."},"sortText":"2dtor"},{"label":"entab","kind":3,"detail":"entab(s,i,...)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Replace spaces with tabs, with stops at columns indicated."},"sortText":"2entab"},{"label":"errorclear","kind":3,"detail":"errorclear()","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Clear error condition."},"sortText":"2errorclear"},{"label":"exit","kind":3,"detail":"exit(i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Exit process with status i, which defaults to 0."},"sortText":"2exit"},{"label":"exp","kind":3,"detail":"exp(r)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"E raised to the power r."},"sortText":"2exp"},{"label":"fattrib","kind":3,"detail":"fattrib(str,att)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Get the attribute of 