"value":"Convert x to an integer, failing if that is not possible."},"sortText":"2integer"},{"label":"ior","kind":3,"detail":"ior(i,j)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Bitwise inclusive OR of i and j."},"sortText":"2ior"},{"label":"ishift","kind":3,"detail":"ishift(i,j)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Produce i shifted j bit positions (left if j\u003c0, right if j\u003e0)."},"sortText":"2ishift"},{"label":"ixor","kind":3,"detail":"ixor(i,j)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Bitwise exclusive OR of i and j."},"sortText":"2ixor"},{"label":"kbhit","kind":3,"detail":"kbhit()","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Check to see if there is a keyboard character waiting to be read."},"sortText":"2kbhit"},{"label":"key","kind":3,"detail":"key(T)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Generate successive keys (entry values) from table T."},"sortText":"2key"},{"label":"left","kind":3,"detail":"left(s1,i,s2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Pad s1 on right with s2 to length i."},"sortText":"2left"},{"label":"list","kind":3,"detail":"list(i,x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Create a list of size i, with initial value x."},"sortText":"2list"},{"label":"loadfunc","kind":3,"detail":"loadfunc(filename,funcname)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Load C function dynamically."},"sortText":"2loadfunc"},{"label":"log","kind":3,"detail":"log(r1,r2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Logarithm of r1 to base r2."},"sortText":"2log"},{"label":"many","kind":3,"detail":"many(c,s,i1,i2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Produces the position in s after the longest initial sequence of characters in c in s[i1:i2] but fails if there is none."},"sortText":"2many"},{"label":"map","kind":3,"detail":"map(s1,s2,s3)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Map s1, using s2 and s3."},"sortText":"2map"},{"label":"match","kind":3,"detail":"match(s1,s2,i1,i2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Produces i1+*s1 if s1==s2[i1+:*s1], but fails otherwise."},"sortText":"2match"},{"label":"member","kind":3,"detail":"member(x1,x2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Returns x1 if x2 is a member of set or table x2 but fails otherwise."},"sortText":"2member"},{"label":"move","kind":3,"detail":"move(i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Move \u0026pos by i, return substring of \u0026subject spanned. Reverses effects if resumed."},"sortText":"2move"},{"label":"name","kind":3,"detail":"name(v)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Return the name of a variable."},"sortText":"2name"},{"label":"numeric","kind":3,"detail":"numeric(x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Produces an integer or real number resulting from the type conversion of x, but fails if the conversion is not possible."},"sortText":"2numeric"},{"label":"open","kind":3,"detail":"open(s1,s2,...)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Open file named s1 with options s2 and attributes given in trailing arguments."},"sortText":"2open"},{"label":"ord","kind":3,"detail":"ord(s)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Produce integer ordinal (value) of single character."},"sortText":"2ord"},{"label":"pop","kind":3,"detail":"pop(L)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Remove and produce an element from the left end of list L (as get)."},"sortText":"2pop"},{"label":"pos","kind":3,"detail":"pos(i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Test if \u0026pos is at position i in \u0026subject."},"sortText":"2pos"},{"label":"proc","kind":3,"detail":"proc(x,i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Convert x to a procedure if possible; use i to resolve ambiguous string names."},"sortText":"2proc"},{"label":"pull","kind":3,"detail":"pull(L)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Pull an element from end of list L."},"sortText":"2pull"},{"label":"push","kind":3,"detail":"push(L,x1,...,xN)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Push x onto beginning of list L."},"sortText":"2push"},{"label":"put","kind":3,"detail":"put(L,x1,...,xN)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Put elements onto end of list L."},"sortText":"2put"},{"label":"read","kind":3,"detail":"read(f)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Read line on file f."},"sortText":"2read"},{"label":"reads","kind":3,"detail":"reads(f,i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Read i bytes on file f."},"sortText":"2reads"},{"label":"real","kind":3,"detail":"real(x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Convert x to a real number, failing if that is not possible."},"sortText":"2real"},{"label":"remove","kind":3,"detail":"remove(s)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Remove the file named s."},"sortText":"2remove"},{"label":"rename","kind":3,"detail":"rename(s1,s2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Rename the file named s1 to have the name s2."},"sortText":"2rename"},{"label":"repl","kind":3,"detail":"repl(s,i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Concatenate i copies of string s."},"sortText":"2repl"},{"label":"reverse","kind":3,"detail":"reverse(s)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Reverse string s."},"sortText":"2reverse"},{"label":"right","kind":3,"detail":"right(s1,i,s2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Pad s1 on left with s2 to length i."},"sortText":"2right"},{"label":"rtod","kind":3,"detail":"rtod(r)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Convert r from radians to degrees."},"sortText":"2rtod"},{"label":"runerr","kind":3,"detail":"runerr(i,x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Produce runtime error i with value x."},"sortText":"2runerr"},{"label":"seek","kind":3,"detail":"seek(f,i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Seek to offset i in file f. [[ What about seek error ? ]]"},"sortText":"2seek"},{"label":"seq","kind":3,"detail":"seq(i,j)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Generate i, i+j, i+2*j, ... ."},"sortText":"2seq"},{"label":"seri